      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Select one couple in <math><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> ways.<br />Remaining <math><mn>5</mn></math> couples have <math><mn>5</mn></math> men and <math><mn>5</mn></math> women.<br />Select two men or two women or one man and one women so that they are not couple.<br />Two men can be selected in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;ways<br />Two women can be selected in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;ways<br />One man and one woman such that they are not a couple&nbsp;can be selected in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>5</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>×</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow></mrow><mn>4</mn></mmultiscripts></math>&nbsp;ways<br />Hence, the total number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mmultiscripts><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mprescripts></mprescripts><mrow><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mmultiscripts></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>240</mn></math>"
